							subject : "Booking Invoice - 90min's Laundry"
							message : "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f7f9fc; color: #333; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img height=\"auto\" width=\"100\" style=\"width: 100px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;\" alt=\"90min's Laundry Logo\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/SNRmp3Qy/Laundry-Management-Logo.png\"> <h2 style=\"margin: 0; color: #0073aa;\">90min's Laundry<br></h2><p style=\"margin: 5px 0; color: #555;\">Fast • Reliable • Affordable Laundry Services<br></p></div><p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Dear <b>${Customer_Name}​</b>,<br></p><p style=\"font-size: 15px;\">Thank you for choosing <b>90min’s Laundry</b>! We truly appreciate your trust in our service.  \n    Kindly find your <b>invoice attached below</b> for your recent booking.<br></p><div style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px 20px; margin-top: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; color: #0073aa; font-size: 18px;\">Invoice Summary<br></h3><p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"><b>ID:</b>&nbsp;${ID}<br></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"><b>Order ID:</b>&nbsp;${Cus_Booking_ID}<br></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"><b>Date:</b>&nbsp;${Booking_Date}<br></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"><b>Total Amount:</b> ₹${Grand_Total}<br></p><p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"><b>Payment Status:</b> Completed<br></p></div><p style=\"margin-top: 15px; font-size: 15px;\">Please review the invoice details carefully. If you have any questions or notice any discrepancies, don’t hesitate to reach out to our support team.<br></p><div style=\"background-color: #eef6fb; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 10px;\"><p style=\"margin: 5px 0;\"><b>Contact Us:</b><br></p><p style=\"margin: 3px 0;\"> <a target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073aa; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"tel:+919876543210\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">+91 98765 43210</a><br></p><p style=\"margin: 3px 0;\"> <a target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073aa; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"mailto:support@90minlaundry.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">support@90minlaundry.com</a><br></p><p style=\"margin: 3px 0;\"> <a target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073aa; text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://90minlaundry.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">www.90minlaundry.com</a><br></p></div><p style=\"margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #555; text-align: center;\">Thanks for choosing <b>90min's Laundry</b>! We look forward to serving you again soon. <br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0; color: #0073aa; font-weight: bold;\"></p><div>Regards,<br></div><div> 90min's Laundry Team<br></div><p></p></div><div><br></div>"
							attachments : template : Booking_Invoice as pdf
						)
